            "size": [
                550.0,
                170.0
            ],
            "text": "UI Controls 3D Scene — Color & Camera\n\nColorPicker changes the sphere material color.\nSlider controls camera Y rotation (orbit).\n\nData flow:\n  UI widgets → ContainerUI (CHOP state port) →\n  PbrMAT albedo_color: per-component expressions\n    chop(\"container1\", \"colorpicker1:r/g/b\")\n  PbrMAT → GeometryCOMP mat_in\n  CameraCOMP ry: expression\n    chop(\"container1\", \"slider_rotation:value\")\n\nEvery UI widget has a CHOP state output. ContainerUI\naggregates all children's states. Widgets are wired\nto WindowOUT panel port for native interactive input.",
            "type": "note"
        }
    ],
